    "updated_at": "2017-11-15T16:50:26Z",
    "body": "We store the source of a given policy in the CSP list: see\r\nhttps://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#contains-a-header-delivered-content-security-policy,\r\nfor example. It shouldn’t be too tough to walk through the policy and\r\ndecide whether it is equivalent to disabling script when parsing the\r\ndocument. Might be some timing issues, but putting something in document\r\ninitialization seems reasonable.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
