    "body": "> Basically similar to\r\n> https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#disown-opener-init or\r\n> https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#sandbox-init\r\n>\r\n> Since those init steps happen before any parsing, they should give us the\r\n> semantics we want.\r\n\r\nRight, exactly. Those get called during document initialization, and should\r\ngive us the information we’d need before parsing.\r\n",
